line	<str>I returned to the Neypotzli Antechamber to find that Zuma had disturbed the seal keeping the Moons of Peril contained. To restore the seal, I gathered some items for Eyatlalli to use as part of a ritual.</str>
line	<str>Eyatlalli started to perform the ritual to restore the seal keeping the Moons of Peril contained. However, she asked me to directly take them on to keep them distracted until the end of the ritual.</str>
line	<col=000080>I confronted and distracted all three of the <col=800000>Moons of Peril</col>, allowing <col=800000>Eyatlalli</col> to complete the ritual. I should now return to her and the others.</col>
